Subject: [PATCH] widen b64t to 65 chars

b64t[64] initialized from a 65-char literal; [65] holds the
NUL and silences -Wunterminated-string-initialization. Index
use (i & 0x3f) is unaffected.
diff --git a/src/password-crypt.c b/src/password-crypt.c
index db69b88..05399c6 100644
--- a/src/password-crypt.c
+++ b/src/password-crypt.c
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
 #define SHA256_DEFAULT_ROUNDS 5000
 #define SHA512_DEFAULT_ROUNDS 5000
 
-static const char b64t[64] =
+static const char b64t[65] =
 "./0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz";
 
 static const char md5_prefix[] = "$1$";
